WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:08.035
The Earth's bulge turns every orbit's plane, a little faster or slower for each height and tilt, so the ring starts to fan out.

00:08.514 --> 00:19.335
Two months after the test, more than 1 200 pieces had been catalogued and nearly 400 more were being tracked, NASA's Orbital Debris Quarterly News reported.
